            <title>[PARQUET-825] Static analyzer findings (NPEs, resource leaks)</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-825</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Static code analyzer tool found some possible issues:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;NPE:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;RecordReaderImplementation:131&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;GlobeNode:61,100,139&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Resource leak:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;ByteBasedBitPackingGenerator:68&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;IntBasedBitPackingGenerator:59&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;VersionGenerator:53&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Don&apos;t catch throwable:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;DumpCommand:334&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Registry:42,57&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;PrettyPrintWriter:82,91&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
